213046147230", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031482_1779213049480563_7642349779976588734_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=L8OOPGqfw8oQ7kNvwHlUpbC&_nc_oc=Adnt-maPqWeCvSFsDYa_7aSUwcDXFzRwY7vxtPotMZXKwHJ8JbZpnPzes8g5d0N5sos&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afvnpd6SUW1uJaBuv1w2wp8GOg2n0D-BGAUlqSFHgBVQxg&oe=69A6C87B"}, {"file_name": "ss5 v2.png", "id": "568316389457273", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031605_568316392790606_20012171714691183_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2-3D06nGXrEQ7kNvwGHSrZ4&_nc_oc=AdkND9QayP7dRB5xjYmowMfAB9OwPORSFDqEhmsFr1kK8vM3gn6Gh37ptNMPMixfGFc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsMhf-IutyAtcg2HE0BpKLpNoBvxltyXVX0lbUUBRj-sw&oe=69A6C885"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Monkey Jumpers V2", "keywords": ["fun", "ghxsty", "spiritgames"], "long_description": "Monkey Jumpers V2 is an immersive multiplayer VR experience that redefines social and competitive gaming. Moving beyond its predecessor's horror theme, V2 introduces a vibrant world with diverse gameplay features, including parkour, zero-gravity, and intricate modes designed for up to 10 players.\n\nPlayers can personalize their monkey with a range of purchasable cosmetics with in-game currency, showcasing their style and achievements. Advanced locomotion mechanics ensure fluid movement, while frequent updates add new maps, cosmetics, and features to keep the experience fresh.\n\nMonkey Jumpers V2 offers a dynamic and engaging environment, blending competitive gameplay with social interaction, making it a standout VR experience.", "short_description": "Monkey Jumpers V2! What could this possibly, be? Monkey Jumpers V2 introduces new features and fun game modes to try out!"}]}, "developer_name": "ghxsty", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/monkey-jumpers-llc/privacy-policy?authuser=0", "developer